01:03:04.900 --> 01:03:09.033
And so, I guess there's
nothing to do but just.

01:03:10.100 --> 01:03:11.750
Oh, are we gonna have audio?

01:03:11.750 --> 01:03:12.900
I guess we'll find out.

01:03:13.870 --> 01:03:14.850
Let's see if this will work.

01:03:14.850 --> 01:03:17.200
Because it's sort of fun
to hear the announcer.

01:03:18.680 --> 01:03:19.760
Um, let's try.

01:03:19.760 --> 01:03:20.593
Go ahead.

01:03:23.900 --> 01:03:24.963
No, I guess not.

01:03:27.710 --> 01:03:28.930
Well anyway, you can see the runners

01:03:28.930 --> 01:03:32.823
