01:04:10.090 --> 01:04:13.280
So and that's like I say, he
was not being disrespectful,

01:04:13.280 --> 01:04:15.360
he's just mischievous, he's
celebrating a little bit.

01:04:15.360 --> 01:04:16.480
He's so far ahead.

01:04:16.480 --> 01:04:21.070
So there was a question,
let's see the next slide.

01:04:21.070 --> 01:04:22.944
I mean that shows you
at the end of the race.

01:04:22.944 --> 01:04:24.340
(audience laughing)

01:04:24.340 --> 01:04:25.190
And, (chuckling).

01:04:27.440 --> 01:04:29.280
You won't be able to see
