01:15:02.290 --> 01:15:05.770
and I've noticed that I
guess, quantum mechanics comes

01:15:05.770 --> 01:15:07.570
to mind, but you can look
at it in either kind of

01:15:07.570 --> 01:15:10.460
a differential calculus way
or a linear algebra way,

01:15:10.460 --> 01:15:12.850
with the calculus being more intuitive,

01:15:12.850 --> 01:15:15.100
but computationally more difficult,

01:15:15.100 --> 01:15:17.410
and the algebra being less intuitive

01:15:17.410 --> 01:15:19.080
but computationally easier,

01:15:19.080 --> 01:15:20.660
and I was wondering if
you could kind of speak

01:15:20.660 --> 01:15:24.190
to the relationship between the two sides.

01:15:24.190 --> 01:15:27.810
- I think I missed one word
early in what you said.

01:15:27.810 --> 01:15:29.790
Are you asking for the
relationship between algebra

01:15:29.790 --> 01:15:31.660
