01:17:14.200 --> 01:17:16.560
I find algebra is not about anything.

01:17:16.560 --> 01:17:19.840
Whereas geometry is about
something, it's just very hard.

01:17:19.840 --> 01:17:22.190
And so when you put geometry
and algebra together,

01:17:22.190 --> 01:17:24.180
now you're really cooking and that's

01:17:24.180 --> 01:17:25.667
what happened in the 1600s.

01:17:27.950 --> 01:17:30.100
