to say anything about that.

01:22:02.380 --> 01:22:05.300
So I think I accept that first point.

01:22:05.300 --> 01:22:07.920
I mean, just that there's something,

01:22:07.920 --> 01:22:11.090
I wonder if though, if
I'm agreeing too quickly

01:22:11.090 --> 01:22:14.650
