01:22:16.000 --> 01:22:19.160
Just that there's some,
towards the end of the book

01:22:19.160 --> 01:22:22.750
I mention one thing that I
regard as very spooky to me,

01:22:22.750 --> 01:22:24.880
that makes think, but I
don't think it will refute

01:22:24.880 --> 01:22:26.870
