you're saying because

01:22:26.870 --> 01:22:29.210
it's still in the realm
of what can be measured.

01:22:29.210 --> 01:22:32.410
I'm just thinking of a case where there

01:22:32.410 --> 01:22:35.330
are certain properties
of subatomic particles,

01:22:35.330 --> 01:22:40.220
of electrons that have been
measured and accurately

01:22:40.220 --> 01:22:43.582
