decimal places with this

01:22:43.582 --> 01:22:47.890
Feynman's part of physics,
quantum electrodynamics.

01:22:47.890 --> 01:22:50.570
That we can understand something

01:22:50.570 --> 01:22:53.040
in the gyromagnetic ratio of the electron

01:22:53.040 --> 01:22:56.720
can be calculated to eight
digits after the decimal point.

01:22:56.720 --> 01:22:58.740
Why am I making a big deal about that?

01:22:58.740 --> 01:23:01.453
I mean, that's that is
so unbelievably accurate,

01:23:02.410 --> 01:23:04.080
but it wasn't built into the theory.

01:23:04.080 --> 01:23:06.250
