01:24:12.841 --> 01:24:14.990
So for religion or whatever,

01:24:14.990 --> 01:24:17.110
I don't think it will have
anything to say about that.

01:24:17.110 --> 01:24:18.770
But then you asked about modernism,

01:24:18.770 --> 01:24:20.300
and I don't feel well enough equipped

01:24:20.300 --> 01:24:22.460
to even know what that,
I don't know enough

01:24:22.460 --> 01:24:26.023
about post-modernism to
know how to respond to that.

01:24:27.060 --> 01:24:28.860
Um, okay, maybe I should try

01:24:28.860 --> 01:24:30.380
